# LF everywhere, on every platform. The gates read Markdown and JSON byte for
# byte (heading matches in AGENTS.md, directory hashes in skills-lock.json), so
# a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true must not turn them into CRLF;
# CRLF also breaks bash shebangs and Docker RUN directives in Linux containers.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files are the one exception: cmd.exe expects CRLF.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
